OL,3,GNEWSACar battery gigafactory builder   
OL,4,Adrops out                              
OL,6,FThe company building the UK's biggest  
OL,7,Felectric vehicle (EV) battery factory  
OL,8,Fhas said its opening remains "on       
OL,9,Ftrack", despite a major contractor     
OL,10,Fstepping away from the project for the 
OL,11,Fsecond time in six months.             
OL,13,FThe gigafactory near Bridgwater in     
OL,14,FSomerset, is being led by Agratas and  
OL,15,Fbuilt on the site of a former ordinance
OL,16,Ffactory, creating around 4,600 jobs    
OL,17,Fonce open.                             
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
