OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACar battery gigafactory builder   
OL,4,Adrops out                              
OL,6,FContractor TSL, which is building the  
OL,7,Ffactory's exterior, will step down once
OL,8,Fthat work is complete, but the company 
OL,9,Fhas declined to say why and it is      
OL,10,Funclear if it had planned further      
OL,11,Finvolvement.                           
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire-based TSL only joined  
OL,14,Fthe project in June after previous lead
OL,15,Fcontractor Sir Robert McAlpine ended   
OL,16,Fits involvement.                       
